==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|hirne}}, {{m|gmh|hërne}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|hirni||brain}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*hirzniją||brain}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*ḱerh₂s-||head}}; see there for the cognates.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/hɪʁn/|[hɪʁn]|[hɪɐ̯n]|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|n|Hirns|gen2=Hirnes|Hirne}}

# {{label|de|countable}} [[brain]] (organ)
#: ''Das '''Hirn''' ist die Schaltzentrale im menschlichen Körper.''
#:: The '''brain''' is the control centre of the human body.
# {{label|de|uncountable}} [[brain]] (meat)
#: ''In Europa wird kaum noch '''Hirn''' gegessen.''
#:: Not much '''brain meat''' is eaten anymore in Europe.

